BEGIN:VCALENDAR\r\nVERSION:2.0\r\nPRODID:-//email-scan//Email Events//EN\r\nCALSCALE:GREGORIAN\r\nMETHOD:PUBLISH\r\nBEGIN:VEVENT\r\nUID:seminar-series---wednesday-24t-2026-06-24-5\r\nDTSTAMP:20260627T135904Z\r\nDTSTART:2026-06-T4T1300\r\nDTEND:2026-06-T4T1400\r\nSUMMARY:SEMINAR SERIES:  WEDNESDAY 24TH JUNE 2026\r\nDESCRIPTION: | Host: Mark Miller\r\nLOCATION:January Andrew gave an excellent talk in the IRR about the role of nitric oxide (NO) in the cardiovascular system. This talk will continue this story by showing recent data from his collaboration with Richard showing how different properties of light affect the vasculature and NO system in human studies.\r\nORGANIZER;CN=Mark Miller:mailto:\r\nEND:VEVENT\r\nEND:VCALENDAR